<title>MOROCCO: UAE president pays private visit to Morocco.</title>
<headline>UAE president pays private visit to Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan arrived late on Thursday on a private visit to Morocco, the Moroccan news agency MAP said on Friday.</p>
<p>The president was met at Rabat airport by King Hassan's second son, Prince Rachid, and officials.</p>
